Licences for the data in external-data/
=======================================

The data in this directory is NOT covered by this project's code licence
(GNU GPL v3, see /LICENSE). None of it is committed: it is fetched by the
scripts named below. Each source keeps its own terms. Per-source details
(URLs, access dates, what each file feeds) are in /DATA_SOURCES.md.

1. EUROCONTROL Aviation Intelligence Unit
   --------------------------------------
   Files:
   - all_pre_departure_delays_2025.csv, all_pre_departure_delays_2026.csv
     (used by the final submission's day-level stages)
   - atfm_slot_adherence_2025.csv, atfm_slot_adherence_2026.csv
   - apt_dly_2025.csv.bz2, apt_dly_2026.csv.bz2
   - airport_traffic_2025.csv, airport_traffic_2026.csv
     (the three ATFM tables were tested and are not used by the final submission)
   Publisher: EUROCONTROL's Aviation Intelligence Unit (https://ansperformance.eu).
   Terms (per the publisher): free to copy and redistribute with attribution;
   non-commercial use only. The terms apply to these files and any table
   derived from them, not to this project's source code.
   Attribution: "Contains data from EUROCONTROL's Aviation Intelligence Unit"
   (https://ansperformance.eu).
   Use for the PRC 2026 Data Challenge was confirmed by the challenge admins
   (Discord, 2026-09-17; reconfirmed 2026-10-09 for ranking-period aggregates).
   Fetched by: src/ingest/fetch_atfm_data.py

2. metar/
   ------
   Hourly METAR reports for the 10 challenge departure airports, retrieved
   from the Iowa Environmental Mesonet (IEM), Iowa State University
   (https://mesonet.agron.iastate.edu/cgi-bin/request/asos.py). The underlying
   observations are NOAA/NWS data, a US federal government work in the public
   domain (17 U.S.C. §105). IEM states no further licence or attribution terms
   for this endpoint; no account or API key is needed.
   Fetched by: src/ingest/fetch_metar_data.py

3. adsb/, adsb-fetch/, adsb-restofyear/, adsb-final2026/
   -----------------------------------------------------
   Day extracts of adsb.lol ADS-B/MLAT tracks around the challenge airports
   (https://github.com/adsblol/globe_history_2025 and globe_history_2026).
   Licence: Open Database License (ODbL) v1.0 for the database; feeder
   contributions CC0. Any redistribution of these extracts or of tables
   derived from them stays under the ODbL.
   Attribution: "Contains data from adsb.lol contributors, made available
   under the ODbL."
   Fetched by: src/ingest/fetch_adsb.py

4. ourairports/
   ------------
   OurAirports airport coordinates
   (https://davidmegginson.github.io/ourairports-data/airports.csv), public
   domain. Used only by an exploratory screen; not used by the final
   submission.
